WEBVTT

00:00:02.083 --> 00:00:04.583
<c.Caption-C2_1>Ai, Ai, Ai, I love you!

00:00:04.750 --> 00:00:07.250
<c.Caption-C3_1>Mai, Mai, Mai, my darling!

00:00:07.375 --> 00:00:09.958
<c.Caption-C4_1>Mii, Mii, Mii, help me!

00:00:10.083 --> 00:00:14.333
<c.Caption-C5_1>Popotan! Popotan! Popotan!

00:00:28.958 --> 00:00:31.125
<c.Caption-C6_1>Moshimo genki wo nakushite

00:00:31.583 --> 00:00:33.916
<c.Caption-C7_1>Tohouni kuretatokiniwa

00:00:34.416 --> 00:00:37.958
<c.Caption-C8_1>Popotan no koe wo kikuno

00:00:39.375 --> 00:00:42.041
<c.Caption-C9_1>Souyo anataga sunaoni

00:00:42.291 --> 00:00:44.458
<c.Caption-C10_1>Natte kokoro wo hirakeba

00:00:45.291 --> 00:00:48.833
<c.Caption-C11_1>Popotan wa oshiete kureru

00:00:49.250 --> 00:00:51.625
<c.Caption-C12_1>Anohito wa kuru? Konai?

00:00:51.791 --> 00:00:54.375
<c.Caption-C13_1>Watashi wo suki? Kirai?

00:00:54.541 --> 00:00:57.125
<c.Caption-C14_1>Konokoi wa uso? Honto?

00:00:58.041 --> 00:01:02.291
<c.Caption-C15_1>Donna kotomo shitteruno

00:01:03.250 --> 00:01:05.833
<c.Caption-C16_1>Moudame popopo

00:01:05.875 --> 00:01:08.708
<c.Caption-C17_1>Moudame popopo

00:01:09.125 --> 00:01:13.958
<c.Caption-C18_1>Wakatterukedo yamerarenai

00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:16.375
<c.Caption-C19_1>Moumuri popopo

00:01:16.750 --> 00:01:18.791
<c.Caption-C20_1>Moumuri popopo

00:01:19.666 --> 00:01:24.500
<c.Caption-C21_1>Yume no yumedemo akeramenaide

00:01:24.708 --> 00:01:26.833
<c.Caption-C22_1>Popotan!

00:01:30.916 --> 00:01:33.916
<c.Subtitle-C2_1>Hurry! You have to stop Ai!

00:01:34.208 --> 00:01:36.916
<c.Subtitle-C3_1>I wonder what's going on with Mii?

00:01:37.083 --> 00:01:39.416
<c.Subtitle-C4_1>She seems to be in a panic.

00:01:48.125 --> 00:01:49.958
<c.Subtitle-C5_1>No way! Why?!

00:01:50.083 --> 00:01:51.208
<c.Subtitle-C6_1>Wh-Where are they?!

00:01:51.208 --> 00:01:52.458
<c.Subtitle-C7_1>Ai!

00:01:53.041 --> 00:01:54.375
<c.Subtitle-C8_1>Mai! Mea!

00:01:54.583 --> 00:01:56.500
<c.Subtitle-C9_1>Mai! Mea!

00:01:56.833 --> 00:01:58.000
<c.Subtitle-C10_1>Why?

00:01:58.000 --> 00:02:00.000
<c.Subtitle-C11_1>Why would this happen

00:01:58.001 --> 00:02:00.000
<c.Subtitle-C11_2>all of a sudden?!

00:02:13.875 --> 00:02:15.541
<c.Subtitle-C12_1>Mai!

00:02:39.291 --> 00:02:40.583
<c.Subtitle-C13_1>No way.

00:02:40.583 --> 00:02:41.666
<c.Subtitle-C14_1>Why?

00:02:43.541 --> 00:02:44.750
<c.Subtitle-C15_1>Ai...

00:02:45.416 --> 00:02:46.416
<c.Subtitle-C16_1>Mii...

00:02:47.375 --> 00:02:49.458
<c.Subtitle-C17_1>Ai! Mii!

00:02:49.500 --> 00:02:51.666
<c.Subtitle-C18_1>Miss Ai! Miss Mii!

00:02:52.208 --> 00:02:53.791
<c.Subtitle-C19_1>What is this?

00:02:53.875 --> 00:02:56.333
<c.Subtitle-C20_1>What's going on here?!

00:02:56.375 --> 00:03:01.708
<c.Caption-C23_1>Amusement Park

00:02:56.376 --> 00:03:01.708
<c.Caption-C23_2>Development Site

00:03:02.541 --> 00:03:04.500
<c.Subtitle-C21_1>Mai!

00:03:25.333 --> 00:03:31.208
<c.Subtitle-C22_1>Mai was left behind in that place.

00:03:31.541 --> 00:03:33.625
<c.Subtitle-C23_1>N-No way!

00:03:36.666 --> 00:03:39.166
<c.Caption-C24_1>Spring Bloom

00:03:37.833 --> 00:03:39.166
<c.Subtitle-C24_1>Spring Bloom?

00:03:40.166 --> 00:03:42.166
<c.Subtitle-C25_1>Then this place must be...

00:03:42.625 --> 00:03:46.666
<c.Subtitle-C26_1>It's Spring Bloom Hot Springs

00:03:42.626 --> 00:03:46.666
<c.Subtitle-C26_2>where we were before!

00:03:46.666 --> 00:03:48.791
<c.Subtitle-C27_1>T-Then this must be...

00:03:49.250 --> 00:03:51.041
<c.Subtitle-C28_1>I guess we didn't jump this time.

00:03:52.916 --> 00:03:54.250
<c.Subtitle-C29_1>Mai!

00:03:56.083 --> 00:03:58.083
<c.Caption-C25_1>Hot Spring Roller Coaster

00:03:58.083 --> 00:04:00.083
<c.Caption-C26_1>Seven Seas Hot Springs

00:04:00.625 --> 00:04:02.458
<c.Subtitle-C30_1>What is all this?

00:04:02.625 --> 00:04:04.041
<c.Subtitle-C31_1>Is this the same place?

00:04:04.083 --> 00:04:07.083
<c.Caption-C27_1>Spring Bloom

00:04:04.084 --> 00:04:07.083
<c.Caption-C27_2>Amusement Park

00:04:07.083 --> 00:04:12.041
<c.Caption-C28_1>I'm Home

00:04:12.916 --> 00:04:15.041
<c.Subtitle-C32_1>Come to think of it, back then...

00:04:15.708 --> 00:04:16.666
<c.Caption-C29_1>Spring Bloom Hot Springs

00:04:15.709 --> 00:04:16.666
<c.Caption-C29_2>Against Amusement Park

00:04:15.710 --> 00:04:16.666
<c.Caption-C29_3>Development!

00:04:17.541 --> 00:04:19.000
<c.Caption-C30_1>Amusement Park

00:04:17.542 --> 00:04:19.000
<c.Caption-C30_2>Development Site

00:04:20.750 --> 00:04:21.958
<c.Subtitle-C33_1>Ai!

00:04:28.333 --> 00:04:29.750
<c.Subtitle-C34_1>Thought so.

00:04:29.750 --> 00:04:32.583
<c.Subtitle-C35_1>We jumped five years forward.

00:04:33.250 --> 00:04:34.458
<c.Subtitle-C36_1>That's right.

00:04:34.458 --> 00:04:36.625
<c.Subtitle-C37_1>Like a normal jump.

00:04:36.625 --> 00:04:39.083
<c.Subtitle-C38_1>Hey, where's Mai?

00:04:39.333 --> 00:04:41.291
<c.Subtitle-C39_1>Where? Where?

00:04:44.541 --> 00:04:46.625
<c.Subtitle-C40_1>Wh-What the heck is this?!

00:04:46.916 --> 00:04:49.750
<c.Subtitle-C41_1>What's this building doing here?!

00:04:50.875 --> 00:04:52.083
<c.Subtitle-C42_1>Who are you?!

00:04:52.083 --> 00:04:53.250
<c.Subtitle-C43_1>Ai?!

00:04:54.000 --> 00:04:55.375
<c.Subtitle-C44_1>Let's go.

00:04:56.541 --> 00:04:58.166
<c.Subtitle-C45_1>Hold it!

00:05:00.916 --> 00:05:02.458
<c.Subtitle-C46_1>Darn!

00:05:02.708 --> 00:05:04.208
<c.Subtitle-C47_1>Where did they go?!

00:05:10.291 --> 00:05:11.958
<c.Subtitle-C48_1>H-Hang on, hang on...

00:05:14.333 --> 00:05:17.625
<c.Subtitle-C49_1>Did you see two girls go that way?

00:05:19.208 --> 00:05:21.916
<c.Subtitle-C50_1>I see. Well, thank you anyway.

00:05:22.291 --> 00:05:24.791
<c.Subtitle-C51_1>They sure got away fast.

00:05:29.666 --> 00:05:30.916
<c.Subtitle-C52_1>You guys!

00:05:31.375 --> 00:05:33.083
<c.Subtitle-C53_1>He found us!

00:05:33.125 --> 00:05:35.375
<c.Subtitle-C54_1>Hold it!

00:05:39.583 --> 00:05:41.791
<c.Subtitle-C55_1>Where are you?!

00:05:43.500 --> 00:05:45.791
<c.Subtitle-C56_1>W-We got away...

00:05:45.833 --> 00:05:46.916
<c.Subtitle-C57_1>Yes.

00:05:46.958 --> 00:05:48.958
<c.Subtitle-C58_1>But, isn't something weird?

00:05:48.958 --> 00:05:49.750
<c.Subtitle-C59_1>Huh?

00:05:49.750 --> 00:05:54.708
<c.Subtitle-C60_1>I mean, usually after we jump,

00:05:49.751 --> 00:05:54.708
<c.Subtitle-C60_2>we end up somewhere else.

00:05:55.041 --> 00:05:55.875
<c.Subtitle-C61_1>Yes.

00:05:55.875 --> 00:05:59.375
<c.Subtitle-C62_1>So why are we in the same place

00:05:55.876 --> 00:05:59.375
<c.Subtitle-C62_2>this time? It's weird.

00:05:59.375 --> 00:06:03.083
<c.Subtitle-C63_1>Yes, it is. There must be some reason.

00:06:03.083 --> 00:06:07.958
<c.Subtitle-C64_1>Perhaps Mai is still in this area.

00:06:08.583 --> 00:06:09.541
<c.Subtitle-C65_1>Really?!

00:06:13.125 --> 00:06:14.250
<c.Subtitle-C66_1>Um...

00:06:14.958 --> 00:06:16.625
<c.Subtitle-C67_1>I have to ask you.

00:06:16.625 --> 00:06:19.875
<c.Subtitle-C68_1>We were in this area 5 years ago.

00:06:19.875 --> 00:06:21.500
<c.Subtitle-C69_1>Do you remember us?

00:06:24.875 --> 00:06:26.458
<c.Subtitle-C70_1>Oh, good.

00:06:26.458 --> 00:06:30.958
<c.Subtitle-C71_1>Do you remember the other

00:06:26.459 --> 00:06:30.958
<c.Subtitle-C71_2>girl who was with us?

00:06:33.541 --> 00:06:36.125
<c.Subtitle-C72_1>Is that right? Thank you very much.

00:06:36.125 --> 00:06:37.333
<c.Subtitle-C73_1>Ai?

00:06:38.083 --> 00:06:40.250
<c.Subtitle-C74_1>Apparently she went east.

00:06:40.250 --> 00:06:41.583
<c.Subtitle-C75_1>Really?!

00:06:48.708 --> 00:06:51.208
<c.Subtitle-C76_1>Mai's that way?

00:06:51.208 --> 00:06:53.125
<c.Subtitle-C77_1>We don't know yet.

00:06:53.125 --> 00:06:56.416
<c.Subtitle-C78_1>But we'll start there.

00:06:56.416 --> 00:06:58.875
<c.Subtitle-C79_1>Let's find her fast.

00:06:59.666 --> 00:07:03.333
<c.Subtitle-C80_1>I'm sure she's feeling very sad

00:06:59.667 --> 00:07:03.333
<c.Subtitle-C80_2>not being able to see you.

00:07:13.000 --> 00:07:16.583
<c.Subtitle-C81_1>For us, it's only been a few hours.

00:07:17.083 --> 00:07:20.791
<c.Subtitle-C82_1>But Mai has spent

00:07:17.084 --> 00:07:20.791
<c.Subtitle-C82_2>the past five years here.

00:07:20.958 --> 00:07:23.291
<c.Subtitle-C83_1>How has she managed to cope?

00:07:24.208 --> 00:07:26.375
<c.Subtitle-C84_1>Five years is a long time.

00:07:26.875 --> 00:07:29.583
<c.Subtitle-C85_1>How has she been all this time?

00:07:30.041 --> 00:07:33.125
<c.Subtitle-C86_1>And what is she like now?

00:07:36.625 --> 00:07:38.583
<c.Caption-C31_1>No Entry

00:07:36.626 --> 00:07:38.583
<c.Caption-C31_2>Spring Bloom Amusement Park

00:07:42.041 --> 00:07:44.083
<c.Subtitle-C87_1>Was that building here last time?

00:07:44.083 --> 00:07:45.125
<c.Subtitle-C88_1>No.

00:07:45.125 --> 00:07:47.916
<c.Subtitle-C89_1>Never seen it.

00:07:45.126 --> 00:07:47.916
<c.Subtitle-C89_2>Maybe a new theme building?

00:07:48.375 --> 00:07:50.375
<c.Subtitle-C90_1>Hey! Come on over here!

00:07:50.958 --> 00:07:52.458
<c.Subtitle-C91_1>Hang on!

00:07:52.958 --> 00:07:54.791
<c.Subtitle-C92_1>Chocolate and vanilla, please.

00:07:59.833 --> 00:08:01.041
<c.Subtitle-C93_1>How weird.

00:08:02.166 --> 00:08:04.208
<c.Subtitle-C94_1>Looks like they sell Christmas stuff here.

00:08:05.333 --> 00:08:07.333
<c.Subtitle-C95_1>Look at that building!

00:08:07.333 --> 00:08:09.541
<c.Subtitle-C96_1>I think it's totally new!

00:08:15.416 --> 00:08:16.666
<c.Subtitle-C97_1>What's the matter?

00:08:23.750 --> 00:08:25.458
<c.Subtitle-C98_1>I wonder where she is.

00:08:25.458 --> 00:08:28.041
<c.Subtitle-C99_1>I wonder if she's really in that town.

00:08:28.208 --> 00:08:31.250
<c.Subtitle-C100_1>We don't know anything quite yet.

00:08:32.083 --> 00:08:34.500
<c.Subtitle-C101_1>Let's try again tomorrow.

00:08:34.500 --> 00:08:35.375
<c.Subtitle-C102_1>Okay.

00:08:44.791 --> 00:08:46.291
<c.Subtitle-C103_1>I'm hungry.

00:08:46.333 --> 00:08:48.791
<c.Subtitle-C104_1>Yes. What do you want to eat?

00:08:49.083 --> 00:08:52.375
<c.Subtitle-C105_1>Anything, as long as

00:08:49.084 --> 00:08:52.375
<c.Subtitle-C105_2>it's not your cooking.

00:08:52.375 --> 00:08:54.791
<c.Subtitle-C106_1>Then what about I make Chinese?

00:08:54.791 --> 00:08:56.041
<c.Subtitle-C107_1>Like I said...

00:08:56.041 --> 00:08:58.708
<c.Subtitle-C108_1>I'll show you what I can do!

00:08:58.708 --> 00:09:00.250
<c.Subtitle-C109_1>That's not what I meant!

00:09:08.500 --> 00:09:09.666
<c.Subtitle-C110_1>Hold it!

00:09:09.666 --> 00:09:10.666
<c.Subtitle-C111_1>Yes?

00:09:21.291 --> 00:09:22.166
<c.Subtitle-C112_1>Hey!

00:09:29.541 --> 00:09:32.375
<c.Subtitle-C113_1>It's been a while, Ai, Mii.

00:09:35.375 --> 00:09:37.958
<c.Subtitle-C114_1>Mai!

00:09:39.541 --> 00:09:41.708
<c.Subtitle-C115_1>Thank goodness!

00:09:39.542 --> 00:09:41.708
<c.Subtitle-C115_2>Thank goodness!

00:09:42.750 --> 00:09:45.625
<c.Subtitle-C116_1>Come on. Don't you cry.

00:09:48.458 --> 00:09:50.541
<c.Subtitle-C117_1>Oh, come on now.

00:10:07.708 --> 00:10:09.916
<c.Subtitle-C118_1>Hey, let's take a bath together!

00:10:10.291 --> 00:10:11.541
<c.Subtitle-C119_1>No.

00:10:11.541 --> 00:10:13.916
<c.Subtitle-C120_1>The bath here is too small.

00:10:15.833 --> 00:10:20.166
<c.Subtitle-C121_1>But I sure didn't recognize you.

00:10:20.208 --> 00:10:23.041
<c.Subtitle-C122_1>You're completely different.

00:10:25.375 --> 00:10:27.666
<c.Subtitle-C123_1>I'm a college student now.

00:10:28.125 --> 00:10:30.416
<c.Subtitle-C124_1>So I look a little more grown up.

00:10:30.416 --> 00:10:32.250
<c.Subtitle-C125_1>Yeah, but...

00:10:33.416 --> 00:10:36.166
<c.Subtitle-C126_1>You still have no puffies.

00:10:36.166 --> 00:10:38.125
<c.Subtitle-C127_1>W-Why, you!

00:10:38.166 --> 00:10:39.458
<c.Subtitle-C128_1>Hey!

00:10:40.416 --> 00:10:44.375
<c.Subtitle-C129_1>I'm sorry for the burden

00:10:40.417 --> 00:10:44.375
<c.Subtitle-C129_2>you had to bear, Mea.

00:10:44.625 --> 00:10:45.750
<c.Subtitle-C130_1>Not at all.

00:10:45.750 --> 00:10:47.416
<c.Subtitle-C131_1>This is my job, after all.

00:10:48.708 --> 00:10:51.166
<c.Subtitle-C132_1>Thank you for taking care of Mai.

00:10:51.166 --> 00:10:54.958
<c.Subtitle-C133_1>You had to help support her

00:10:51.167 --> 00:10:54.958
<c.Subtitle-C133_2>through senior high school...

00:10:54.958 --> 00:10:56.833
<c.Subtitle-C134_1>...and graduation.

00:10:56.833 --> 00:10:59.166
<c.Subtitle-C135_1>And then college entrance.

00:10:59.375 --> 00:11:01.541
<c.Subtitle-C136_1>I am the "Invincible Maid"!

00:11:02.416 --> 00:11:06.500
<c.Subtitle-C137_1>There are a lot of households

00:11:02.417 --> 00:11:06.500
<c.Subtitle-C137_2>short of staff if you look.

00:11:06.500 --> 00:11:09.750
<c.Subtitle-C138_1>We did not suffer any financial

00:11:06.501 --> 00:11:09.750
<c.Subtitle-C138_2>difficulty in the past five years.

00:11:10.750 --> 00:11:13.000
<c.Subtitle-C139_1>Oh. Well, thank you.

00:11:15.500 --> 00:11:18.458
<c.Subtitle-C140_1>Hey! Dry your hair properly!

00:11:21.041 --> 00:11:22.666
<c.Subtitle-C141_1>I feel so happy.

00:11:23.000 --> 00:11:24.916
<c.Subtitle-C142_1>Because I'm drying your hair?

00:11:25.791 --> 00:11:28.541
<c.Subtitle-C143_1>That doesn't seem right.

00:11:25.792 --> 00:11:28.541
<c.Subtitle-C143_2>That's not like you, Mii.

00:11:28.541 --> 00:11:29.833
<c.Subtitle-C144_1>That's not it.

00:11:29.833 --> 00:11:33.041
<c.Subtitle-C145_1>Now that we found you,

00:11:29.834 --> 00:11:33.041
<c.Subtitle-C145_2>we can carry on with our journey.

00:11:33.041 --> 00:11:35.375
<c.Subtitle-C146_1>I was feeling happy thinking of that.

00:11:38.833 --> 00:11:39.958
<c.Subtitle-C147_1>What's the matter?

00:11:39.958 --> 00:11:42.875
<c.Subtitle-C148_1>Well, it's about that.

00:11:44.625 --> 00:11:46.750
<c.Subtitle-C149_1>I don't want to go on the journey.

00:11:47.208 --> 00:11:48.083
<c.Subtitle-C150_1>What?

00:11:48.291 --> 00:11:52.333
<c.Subtitle-C151_1>In fact, I want to stay here forever if I can.

00:11:52.333 --> 00:11:53.625
<c.Subtitle-C152_1>Mai?

00:11:55.708 --> 00:11:57.875
<c.Subtitle-C153_1>W-W-What?!

00:11:57.875 --> 00:11:59.291
<c.Subtitle-C154_1>What do you mean?!

00:12:07.916 --> 00:12:09.041
<c.Subtitle-C155_1>Popotan.

00:12:12.916 --> 00:12:14.041
<c.Subtitle-C156_1>Popotan.

00:12:18.791 --> 00:12:21.416
<c.Subtitle-C157_1>Did you hear that? Class is cancelled!

00:12:21.416 --> 00:12:22.500
<c.Subtitle-C158_1>Is that so?

00:12:23.458 --> 00:12:26.958
<c.Subtitle-C159_1>Five years was a long time.

00:12:30.458 --> 00:12:33.708
<c.Subtitle-C160_1>It took a long time for Mai...

00:12:33.708 --> 00:12:35.791
<c.Subtitle-C161_1>...to come around to accepting her fate.

00:12:36.666 --> 00:12:39.541
<c.Subtitle-C162_1>She was abandoned for five years...

00:12:39.541 --> 00:12:43.083
<c.Subtitle-C163_1>...so she was able to stay in

00:12:39.542 --> 00:12:43.083
<c.Subtitle-C163_2>one place for that long.

00:12:43.375 --> 00:12:47.708
<c.Subtitle-C164_1>This was the first time Mai was able

00:12:43.376 --> 00:12:47.708
<c.Subtitle-C164_2>to experience life like that.

00:12:49.000 --> 00:12:54.083
<c.Subtitle-C165_1>It was difficult for her to make

00:12:49.001 --> 00:12:54.083
<c.Subtitle-C165_2>friends at first, but eventually...

00:12:59.500 --> 00:13:03.833
<c.Subtitle-C166_1>If she continues on her journey she

00:12:59.501 --> 00:13:03.833
<c.Subtitle-C166_2>won't be able to live like this again.

00:13:04.333 --> 00:13:06.583
<c.Subtitle-C167_1>Even if she made friends...

00:13:06.583 --> 00:13:08.875
<c.Subtitle-C168_1>...eventually she'd have to

00:13:06.584 --> 00:13:08.875
<c.Subtitle-C168_2>leave them forever.

00:13:09.083 --> 00:13:12.291
<c.Subtitle-C169_1>And that pattern would

00:13:09.084 --> 00:13:12.291
<c.Subtitle-C169_2>repeat itself over and over.

00:13:12.458 --> 00:13:16.583
<c.Subtitle-C170_1>So, that's why she doesn't want to

00:13:12.459 --> 00:13:16.583
<c.Subtitle-C170_2>lose the life she's had here.

00:13:16.583 --> 00:13:18.500
<c.Subtitle-C171_1>I'm sure that's how she feels.

00:13:19.250 --> 00:13:20.666
<c.Subtitle-C172_1>Especially considering that...

00:13:20.666 --> 00:13:25.041
<c.Subtitle-C173_1>...Miss Mai had always felt that

00:13:20.667 --> 00:13:25.041
<c.Subtitle-C173_2>the journey was a tough one.

00:13:25.958 --> 00:13:27.041
<c.Subtitle-C174_1>Yes.

00:13:27.041 --> 00:13:28.166
<c.Subtitle-C175_1>I know that.

00:13:28.958 --> 00:13:30.291
<c.Subtitle-C176_1>Why?

00:13:30.291 --> 00:13:34.333
<c.Subtitle-C177_1>Why do we have to move

00:13:30.292 --> 00:13:34.333
<c.Subtitle-C177_2>over and over again?

00:13:36.833 --> 00:13:39.416
<c.Subtitle-C178_1>I'm sure that's what Mai would think.

00:13:39.916 --> 00:13:43.833
<c.Subtitle-C179_1>I don't want to hurt her...

00:13:43.833 --> 00:13:46.833
<c.Subtitle-C180_1>...but it's something we can't help.

00:13:52.916 --> 00:13:55.125
<c.Subtitle-C181_1>That was really a lot of fun!

00:13:58.791 --> 00:13:59.916
<c.Subtitle-C182_1>It's weird.

00:13:59.916 --> 00:14:03.916
<c.Subtitle-C183_1>It's really weird that Mai

00:13:59.917 --> 00:14:03.916
<c.Subtitle-C183_2>would be talking like that.

00:14:05.625 --> 00:14:07.958
<c.Subtitle-C184_1>There must be some kind of reason.

00:14:08.125 --> 00:14:10.875
<c.Subtitle-C185_1>We're going to get to

00:14:08.126 --> 00:14:10.875
<c.Subtitle-C185_2>the bottom of this mystery!

00:14:13.000 --> 00:14:15.583
<c.Subtitle-C186_1>Everyone's crazy about these chili dogs.

00:14:15.583 --> 00:14:17.500
<c.Subtitle-C187_1>Really? Can I have a bite?

00:14:17.916 --> 00:14:18.875
<c.Subtitle-C188_1>Sure!

00:14:19.583 --> 00:14:21.125
<c.Subtitle-C189_1>Thanks!

00:14:23.416 --> 00:14:27.333
<c.Subtitle-C190_1>Mai, you still eat the same way

00:14:23.417 --> 00:14:27.333
<c.Subtitle-C190_2>you always did.

00:14:27.333 --> 00:14:30.708
<c.Subtitle-C191_1>It's true! The same as when

00:14:27.334 --> 00:14:30.708
<c.Subtitle-C191_2>you were in high school!

00:14:31.125 --> 00:14:32.833
<c.Subtitle-C192_1>R-Really?

00:14:33.958 --> 00:14:36.625
<c.Subtitle-C193_1>And not only the way you eat.

00:14:36.625 --> 00:14:38.125
<c.Subtitle-C194_1>Wh-What?

00:14:38.250 --> 00:14:42.166
<c.Subtitle-C195_1>You haven't really changed

00:14:38.251 --> 00:14:42.166
<c.Subtitle-C195_2>much over the years.

00:14:42.583 --> 00:14:43.666
<c.Subtitle-C196_1>What?!

00:14:43.666 --> 00:14:47.291
<c.Subtitle-C197_1>But hey, my hair's much longer!

00:14:47.291 --> 00:14:49.416
<c.Subtitle-C198_1>Yeah, but...

00:14:49.416 --> 00:14:51.583
<c.Subtitle-C199_1>You know...

00:14:52.375 --> 00:14:54.458
<c.Subtitle-C200_1>Y-You really think so?

00:14:54.458 --> 00:14:57.125
<c.Subtitle-C201_1>You're saying I haven't grown up?

00:14:58.916 --> 00:15:01.291
<c.Subtitle-C202_1>Oh. Come on, Mai. We're just joking!

00:15:01.291 --> 00:15:04.958
<c.Subtitle-C203_1>Th-That's right! Don't get so serious.

00:15:05.125 --> 00:15:08.791
<c.Subtitle-C204_1>How dare you toy with me!

00:15:08.791 --> 00:15:10.291
<c.Subtitle-C205_1>You guys!

00:15:11.333 --> 00:15:12.666
<c.Subtitle-C206_1>Hey!

00:15:13.166 --> 00:15:14.041
<c.Subtitle-C207_1>Mai!

00:15:14.041 --> 00:15:15.208
<c.Subtitle-C208_1>Hey!

00:15:16.166 --> 00:15:17.833
<c.Subtitle-C209_1>Mai...

00:15:18.250 --> 00:15:19.541
<c.Subtitle-C210_1>Oh, no! Maybe...

00:15:21.666 --> 00:15:23.666
<c.Subtitle-C211_1>The Yakisoba sandwich I gave you!

00:15:24.416 --> 00:15:28.125
<c.Subtitle-C212_1>Until you pay me back,

00:15:24.417 --> 00:15:28.125
<c.Subtitle-C212_2>we're not letting you go!

00:15:28.166 --> 00:15:29.375
<c.Subtitle-C213_1>No!

00:15:30.083 --> 00:15:32.791
<c.Subtitle-C214_1>Maybe it's something like that.

00:15:34.916 --> 00:15:37.083
<c.Subtitle-C215_1>Get away from Mai!

00:15:41.125 --> 00:15:42.250
<c.Subtitle-C216_1>M-Mii!

00:15:42.250 --> 00:15:43.750
<c.Subtitle-C217_1>Who is this girl?!

00:15:46.166 --> 00:15:48.250
<c.Subtitle-C218_1>Will you two just stop?!

00:15:48.291 --> 00:15:50.291
<c.Subtitle-C219_1>What are you doing?!

00:15:51.083 --> 00:15:53.875
<c.Subtitle-C220_1>Don't mess with my sister Mai!

00:15:54.250 --> 00:15:56.208
<c.Subtitle-C221_1>Mii?! You've got it wrong!

00:16:05.958 --> 00:16:08.083
<c.Subtitle-C222_1>Mai? You're...

00:16:16.208 --> 00:16:17.458
<c.Subtitle-C223_1>Mai!

00:16:28.583 --> 00:16:29.916
<c.Subtitle-C224_1>Mai...

00:16:34.208 --> 00:16:35.250
<c.Subtitle-C225_1>Give it to me.

00:16:36.250 --> 00:16:37.416
<c.Subtitle-C226_1>Okay...

00:16:43.750 --> 00:16:45.291
<c.Subtitle-C227_1>What's that?

00:16:45.291 --> 00:16:47.166
<c.Subtitle-C228_1>That's right! It's a wig!

00:16:47.166 --> 00:16:48.666
<c.Subtitle-C229_1>Got a problem with that?!

00:16:49.250 --> 00:16:51.083
<c.Subtitle-C230_1>M-Mai...

00:16:52.500 --> 00:16:54.666
<c.Subtitle-C231_1>My hair doesn't grow.

00:16:55.208 --> 00:16:57.250
<c.Subtitle-C232_1>That's why I wear a wig.

00:16:57.500 --> 00:17:01.041
<c.Subtitle-C233_1>People thought it was weird

00:16:57.501 --> 00:17:01.041
<c.Subtitle-C233_2>that my hair wouldn't grow.

00:17:01.041 --> 00:17:04.041
<c.Subtitle-C234_1>And if I lost friends over

00:17:01.042 --> 00:17:04.041
<c.Subtitle-C234_2>something like that...

00:17:04.083 --> 00:17:05.791
<c.Subtitle-C235_1>...I...

00:17:05.791 --> 00:17:08.000
<c.Subtitle-C236_1>And it's not just your hair.

00:17:08.541 --> 00:17:09.583
<c.Subtitle-C237_1>Ai?

00:17:12.333 --> 00:17:15.416
<c.Subtitle-C238_1>It's not just the hair that hasn't

00:17:12.334 --> 00:17:15.416
<c.Subtitle-C238_2>grown in the past five years.

00:17:16.625 --> 00:17:21.041
<c.Subtitle-C239_1>Your body hasn't changed at all, has it?

00:17:21.791 --> 00:17:24.458
<c.Subtitle-C240_1>Ai, how would you know

00:17:21.792 --> 00:17:24.458
<c.Subtitle-C240_2>something like that?

00:17:25.666 --> 00:17:26.875
<c.Subtitle-C241_1>Ai?

00:17:30.625 --> 00:17:32.333
<c.Subtitle-C242_1>I always knew it.

00:17:33.166 --> 00:17:35.041
<c.Subtitle-C243_1>But I didn't want to acknowledge it.

00:17:36.041 --> 00:17:38.750
<c.Subtitle-C244_1>That's why I've tried to

00:17:36.042 --> 00:17:38.750
<c.Subtitle-C244_2>make myself look older.

00:17:38.791 --> 00:17:41.250
<c.Subtitle-C245_1>Even if it's just on the surface.

00:17:42.375 --> 00:17:44.916
<c.Subtitle-C246_1>But I suppose eventually

00:17:42.376 --> 00:17:44.916
<c.Subtitle-C246_2>I would've been found out.

00:17:47.791 --> 00:17:50.666
<c.Subtitle-C247_1>Hey, is there a reason why we don't grow?

00:17:53.166 --> 00:17:54.291
<c.Subtitle-C248_1>It's the house.

00:17:55.750 --> 00:18:00.458
<c.Subtitle-C249_1>We do not age during the time

00:17:55.751 --> 00:18:00.458
<c.Subtitle-C249_2>we spend away from the house.

00:18:01.208 --> 00:18:04.083
<c.Subtitle-C250_1>Really? I'm like that, too?

00:18:04.791 --> 00:18:08.916
<c.Subtitle-C251_1>I'm sorry. I should've told you earlier.

00:18:09.750 --> 00:18:12.208
<c.Subtitle-C252_1>But this is a hard fact.

00:18:12.208 --> 00:18:14.958
<c.Subtitle-C253_1>I thought you would be better off

00:18:12.209 --> 00:18:14.958
<c.Subtitle-C253_2>without knowing it.

00:18:15.541 --> 00:18:17.208
<c.Subtitle-C254_1>I knew it.

00:18:17.291 --> 00:18:19.791
<c.Subtitle-C255_1>I knew it was something like that.

00:18:20.791 --> 00:18:23.000
<c.Subtitle-C256_1>But, you know...

00:18:23.750 --> 00:18:27.375
<c.Subtitle-C257_1>...what if I said that I wanted

00:18:23.751 --> 00:18:27.375
<c.Subtitle-C257_2>to stay right here?

00:18:29.166 --> 00:18:30.375
<c.Subtitle-C258_1>Yeah!

00:18:30.375 --> 00:18:34.333
<c.Subtitle-C259_1>When we're about to be found out,

00:18:30.376 --> 00:18:34.333
<c.Subtitle-C259_2>we just move on.

00:18:34.666 --> 00:18:36.666
<c.Subtitle-C260_1>And then we start over

00:18:36.666 --> 00:18:39.833
<c.Subtitle-C261_1>...and try to make it look like

00:18:36.667 --> 00:18:39.833
<c.Subtitle-C261_2>we're gradually growing older.

00:18:39.833 --> 00:18:43.041
<c.Subtitle-C262_1>Then, if it looks like we're

00:18:39.834 --> 00:18:43.041
<c.Subtitle-C262_2>going to be found out...

00:18:43.041 --> 00:18:45.166
<c.Subtitle-C263_1>...we move again to another place.

00:18:48.000 --> 00:18:53.291
<c.Subtitle-C264_1>But I guess that makes it

00:18:48.001 --> 00:18:53.291
<c.Subtitle-C264_2>no different than our journey.

00:18:55.583 --> 00:18:56.583
<c.Subtitle-C265_1>Mai...

00:18:57.583 --> 00:18:58.583
<c.Subtitle-C266_1>I understand.

00:19:00.291 --> 00:19:01.458
<c.Subtitle-C267_1>I know that.

00:19:02.291 --> 00:19:03.500
<c.Subtitle-C268_1>But...

00:19:04.166 --> 00:19:05.333
<c.Subtitle-C269_1>But...

00:19:05.583 --> 00:19:06.916
<c.Subtitle-C270_1>But I...!

00:19:41.250 --> 00:19:45.750
<c.Caption-C32_1>Spring Bloom

00:19:41.251 --> 00:19:45.750
<c.Caption-C32_2>Amusement Park

00:19:42.416 --> 00:19:45.666
<c.Subtitle-C271_1>But what's the deal with this house?

00:19:48.541 --> 00:19:50.250
<c.Subtitle-C272_1>The two from the other day!

00:19:50.250 --> 00:19:51.500
<c.Subtitle-C273_1>You hiding in there!

00:19:51.875 --> 00:19:53.708
<c.Subtitle-C274_1>You won't get away this time!

00:19:56.708 --> 00:19:58.291
<c.Subtitle-C275_1>Rock, paper, scissors.

00:19:59.125 --> 00:20:00.958
<c.Subtitle-C276_1>Look that way...

00:20:04.666 --> 00:20:07.375
<c.Subtitle-C277_1>Now! Hurry up, everyone!

00:20:07.958 --> 00:20:09.458
<c.Subtitle-C278_1>It's heavy!

00:20:09.708 --> 00:20:13.041
<c.Subtitle-C279_1>It's five years worth of clothes

00:20:09.709 --> 00:20:13.041
<c.Subtitle-C279_2>and household items.

00:20:14.625 --> 00:20:15.583
<c.Subtitle-C280_1>Mai?

00:20:16.041 --> 00:20:17.583
<c.Subtitle-C281_1>What about your friends?

00:20:17.833 --> 00:20:18.833
<c.Subtitle-C282_1>Yeah.

00:20:18.833 --> 00:20:20.916
<c.Subtitle-C283_1>I said goodbye last night.

00:20:22.875 --> 00:20:25.416
<c.Subtitle-C284_1>I'm used to saying goodbye.

00:20:29.958 --> 00:20:32.916
<c.Subtitle-C285_1>But this whole situation sure was...

00:20:33.041 --> 00:20:34.208
<c.Subtitle-C286_1>Could it be...?!

00:20:59.250 --> 00:21:00.583
<c.Subtitle-C287_1>Ai!

00:21:01.666 --> 00:21:02.833
<c.Subtitle-C288_1>Miss Ai!

00:21:03.250 --> 00:21:04.458
<c.Subtitle-C289_1>Hurry!

00:21:05.083 --> 00:21:06.583
<c.Subtitle-C290_1>I'm coming!

00:21:11.458 --> 00:21:14.541
<c.Subtitle-C291_1>Make sure we all stick together this time.

00:21:14.958 --> 00:21:15.958
<c.Subtitle-C292_1>Yeah.

00:22:11.833 --> 00:22:15.083
<c.Caption-C33_1>Tekuno panku de aishitetainoyo

00:22:15.083 --> 00:22:18.625
<c.Caption-C34_1>Denpa ni nosete daisuki suki suki

00:22:18.625 --> 00:22:22.083
<c.Caption-C35_1>Romanchikku wo anatani agetai

00:22:22.083 --> 00:22:23.708
<c.Caption-C36_1>Waratte hoshii

00:22:23.708 --> 00:22:25.500
<c.Caption-C37_1>I love, love, love you

00:22:25.500 --> 00:22:28.791
<c.Caption-C38_1>S.U.K.I. dokidoki love

00:22:28.833 --> 00:22:32.333
<c.Caption-C39_1>S.U.K.I. gimigimi kiss

00:22:32.333 --> 00:22:35.875
<c.Caption-C40_1>S.U.K.I. sukisuki love

00:22:35.875 --> 00:22:39.458
<c.Caption-C41_1>S.U.K.I. sukiari kiss

00:22:39.458 --> 00:22:41.208
<c.Caption-C42_1>Mawaru mawaru

00:22:41.208 --> 00:22:43.083
<c.Caption-C43_1>Jikuu no hariga

00:22:43.083 --> 00:22:46.583
<c.Caption-C44_1>Kimi to boku no zahyou wo sasuno

00:22:46.583 --> 00:22:49.708
<c.Caption-C45_1>Toketeikuwa ai no himitsu

00:22:49.708 --> 00:22:54.125
<c.Caption-C46_1>Dokidoki surukoto madamada shiritaiwa

00:22:56.666 --> 00:23:03.375
<c.Caption-C47_1>Every boy, every girl kiseki wo

00:22:56.667 --> 00:23:03.375
<c.Caption-C47_2>shinjitara mirakuru kurukuru

00:23:03.833 --> 00:23:10.375
<c.Caption-C48_1>Kitto mitsukaruwa beriberi

00:23:03.834 --> 00:23:10.375
<c.Caption-C48_2>surotoberi dei beriberi beriberi

00:23:10.666 --> 00:23:16.750
<c.Caption-C49_1>Itsuka sayonara ga

00:23:10.667 --> 00:23:16.750
<c.Caption-C49_2>yattekitatte daijoubunakurai

00:23:16.750 --> 00:23:21.500
<c.Caption-C50_1>Motto anatani sukisuki daisuki tsutaetai

00:23:21.500 --> 00:23:24.583
<c.Caption-C51_1>I love you! I, I love you!

00:23:27.791 --> 00:23:30.416
<c.Subtitle-C293_1>Transform! Una!

00:23:41.125 --> 00:23:44.666
<c.Subtitle-C294_1>Well, was I cute in that episode?

00:23:46.000 --> 00:24:03.166
<c.Caption-C52_1>Things That Cannot Be Said

00:23:46.958 --> 00:23:50.583
<c.Subtitle-C295_1>Okay, the next episode of Popotan is

00:23:46.959 --> 00:23:50.583
<c.Subtitle-C295_2>"Things That Cannot Be Said".

00:23:50.583 --> 00:23:52.833
<c.Subtitle-C296_1>I know that all you're seeing are

00:23:50.584 --> 00:23:52.833
<c.Subtitle-C296_2>previews that aren't previews...

00:23:52.833 --> 00:23:55.625
<c.Subtitle-C297_1>...and I've been criticized for it.

00:23:55.625 --> 00:23:57.333
<c.Subtitle-C298_1>But I'm not about to give up!

00:23:57.708 --> 00:24:01.458
<c.Subtitle-C299_1>One day I'll show you a preview

00:23:57.709 --> 00:24:01.458
<c.Subtitle-C299_2>that reveals all the juicy details...

00:24:01.458 --> 00:24:03.291
<c.Subtitle-C300_1>...so that you won't have to

00:24:01.459 --> 00:24:03.291
<c.Subtitle-C300_2>watch the show!

00:24:07.333 --> 00:24:09.750
<c.Subtitle-C301_1>Good night, everyone!
